{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every phone situated on the top side of the image, there is a neatly arranged collection of objects associated with it. A pair of headphones is placed to the left of the phone, and a ruler is located to the left of the headphones. A wrench aligns vertically with the headphones, while a drill aligns vertically with the ruler; notably, the drill is larger than the wrench. Further extending the arrangement, a bottle is positioned to the left of the drill, and a donut is placed to the left of the bottle. The donut is located on the left side of the image and is smaller than the bottle.",
